# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# CREAMS Commit Message SOP — docs/COMMIT_MESSAGE_SOP.md
#
# Title line:
#   Type(Scope): Description.   ← sentence case, ends with full stop, ≤72 chars
#   Types: Feat | Fix | Refactor | Docs | Test | Chore | Security
#   Scopes: Auth | Models | Ci | Seeder | Routes | Views | Middleware | Governance
#
# "Verified that" — number each item, name the real check you ran
#   Good: "php artisan test --filter=X passes (N tests, 0 failures)."
#   Bad:  "tests pass"
#
# Avoid: vague claims, em dashes, title-case headings, AI polish
# Use: UK English, direct wording, honest if incomplete
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
